WEBVTT

00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:31.662
It's a catastrophe.

00:02:31.686 --> 00:02:33.154
It's sweeping the world.

00:02:33.178 --> 00:02:35.391
England is right behind you, as usual.

00:02:36.153 --> 00:02:40.360
(Laughter)

00:02:40.384 --> 00:02:42.407
I know they were close,
but not that close.

00:02:43.106 --> 00:02:44.454
We need a revolution.

00:02:44.478 --> 00:02:46.757
Mexico, Australia, Germany,

00:02:46.781 --> 00:02:48.009
India, China,

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:51.144
all have massive problems
of obesity and bad health.

00:02:52.725 --> 00:02:53.916
Think about smoking.

00:02:55.034 --> 00:02:56.916
It costs way less than obesity now.

00:02:57.677 --> 00:03:02.587
Obesity costs you Americans
10 percent of your health-care bills,